As I see it, color alchemy should generally alleviate this
problem.  As it is, healing potions are quite common, which
is why people are able to create huge stacks of full healing
potions.  (As you only need a couple gain energy/gain level
to convert them all.)  If the required potions are random,
then in most games that becomes rather more difficult.

